    lib_nogc_sync_mut_behavioral_failures_2026-09-16, 0, "2026-11-28 p3sweep8: fixed this lane (4): shader_compile_spec 18/18 (wgsl_emitter.spl documented void main() to @vertex/@fragment fn but never implemented it - added _convert_vertex_entry/_convert_fragment_entry + VertexOutput/FragmentOutput boilerplate); gpu_queue_usm 34/34 (UsmBuffer.native_pinned added); js_vm_reclamation (nogc_async_mut variant) 4/4 (EnvironmentStack contract: env_parent_ids/next_id lockstep with frames, create_env rejects bad parents, 6 js-engine neighbours green); durable_atomic_bytes PASS (file_atomic_write_bytes_durable: staging + fsync + rename, failure cleans up). Already green at baseline (re-verified): 14 more specs. Remaining RED (owner lanes, documented): concurrent_thread_pointer_spawn_spec pins the pre-P0 pointer ABI (retiring it would reintroduce the P0 flake); env_platform_process_owner_spec root-caused as a seed import-table constructor resolution artifact (any second import fixes it); js_vm_reclamation nogc_sync_mut variant is an intentional RED fail-fast pending the frozen JsHeapHandle ABI; linalg raw_memory_owner 0/4 (owner lane per the 2026-11-13 addendum). close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/lib/nogc_sync_mut/engine/render/shader_compile_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/lib/nogc_sync_mut/gpu/gpu_queue_usm_spec.spl"

